# For a human terminal: `direnv allow` once and cargo, rustc, lld, node and
# python3 are on PATH whenever you are in this directory, out of the flake's
# devShell (which is shell.nix, pinned by flake.lock).
#
# Claude Code's Bash tool does not go through direnv; a global SessionStart hook
# (~/.claude/hooks/nix-toolchain-env.sh) reads this file and does the same job.
use flake
